Hi Greg,

Thanks for the interest.
Sorry but it's hard to say definitively without knowing more about your application. But it certainly seems reasonable to create a separate directory for each logical "app".
Currently it doesn't, we intentionally kept the focus on single-page applications for now. I suspect we may need to address this in version 2 though--if not multi-page apps in the sense of distinct URLs, at least the ability to support multiple-step workflows.
That's an excellent question. We will definitely support that and the architecture is designed for it, but it's possible that it might only be included in the enterprise version of Shiny Server. It's unlikely in any case to be part of the initial January beta release, though; we already have a lot to do between now and then!

